    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/f0f94e0219906e685f87b2cddd754619.svg) ⟨28⟩\nUncertainty-42⟨28⟩\n/\nPascalVOC_NAMLab_pt⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nTasks:  Image Segmentation ⟨30⟩\nTags:  wsss ⟨31⟩ boundary-refinement ⟨32⟩ priors ⟨33⟩\nLicense:\nmit\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨34⟩ Community ⟨35⟩\nDataset Viewer\nThe dataset viewer is not available because its heuristics could not detect any supported data files⟨36⟩. You can try uploading⟨37⟩ some data files, or configuring⟨38⟩ the data files location manually.\n  * 🔗 Main Codebase⟨39⟩\n  * 📂 Expected Directory Layout⟨40⟩\n  * 📥 Extraction Command⟨41⟩\n  * 📝 Citation & Attribution⟨42⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨43⟩ PASCAL VOC 2012 NAMLab Priors for HGA \nThis dataset repository hosts the pre-computed hierarchical invariant region partition priors for weakly supervised semantic segmentation (WSSS), generated using the NAMLab framework.\nThese priors serve as the 2D structural guidance stream for the **HGA (Hierarchical-Geometric Alignment)** boundary internalization paradigm.\n##   ⟨39⟩ 🔗 Main Codebase \nThe complete implementation, environment setup, and training guidelines are available in our official GitHub repository: 👉 **Uncertainty-42/HGA⟨44⟩**\n##   ⟨40⟩ 📂 Expected Directory Layout \nDownload the `priors_voc.zip` archive (approx. 4.2 GB) and extract its contents into your local PASCAL VOC dataset structure as shown below:\n\n```\nVOCdevkit/VOC2012/\n├── JPEGImages/                # Original source images (.jpg)\n├── SegmentationClassAug/      # Ground Truth masks (.png)\n└── priors/                    \n    └── namlab_pt/             # <- Extract zip contents directly here (.pt files)\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨41⟩ 📥 Extraction Command \nNavigate to your local `priors/` directory and run:\n\n```\nunzip priors_voc.zip -d namlab_pt/\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨42⟩ 📝 Citation & Attribution \nIf you use these priors in your research, please cite both our work and the foundational NAMLab paper:\n\n```\n@article{zheng2021hierarchical,\n  title={Hierarchical Image Segmentation Based on Nonsymmetry and Anti-Packing Pattern Representation Model},\n  author={Zheng, Yunping and Yang, Bowen and Sarem, Mudar},\n  journal={IEEE Transactions on Image Processing},\n  volume={30},\n  pages={2408--2421},\n  year={2021},\n  publisher={IEEE}\n}\n\n```\n\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    40\nTotal file size: 6.17 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨45⟩ Privacy⟨46⟩ About⟨47⟩ Careers⟨48⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
